Readings transcribed from the 2026-09-09 Playwright run against
scripts/avatar/live-preview.html. These are the values the page's own
evaluate() calls returned; the page is a dev-server session, so this file is
the only record of them. Every gate that reads a number derived from these is
named beside it.

Dev server: npm run dev (Vite, :5173). Browser: Playwright Chromium, dpr 1.
Page: live-preview.html?model=/avatar/vroid-studio-dressup.vrm&mikadebug=1
with live-preview-config.ts's MIKA_MILFY_FAMILY temporarily set to
'vroid-studio-dressup' (put back afterwards).

