== 4. the procedural layer, on the SHIPPED body (finding, not fixed) ==
  Page: live-preview.html?mikadebug=1 with no ?model=, so the default
  /avatar/mika-milfy-12.vrm, metaVersion "0".

  at rest, head.rotation.x driven from 0 to 0.3 by hand:
    the head bone's own +Y axis in world moved -0.2957 in Z
    (scene.rotation.y is pi, rotateVRM0 having run)
  her face direction: leftEye is +0.0274 in world Z from the head bone, so
  she faces the camera at +Z

  playGesture('bow') at its peak (spineX 0.318, headX 0.185, chestX 0.005):
    head   y 1.3196 -> 1.2931, z -0.0087 -> -0.1275  (-118.8mm in Z)
    leftEye                                          (-148.0mm in Z)
  so the shipped body's bow carries her head AWAY from the viewer. The
  offline probe (pitch-0909-probe.ts) gets -121.8mm for the same offsets;
  the 3mm is the idle sway the live body also carries.
